[
    {
        "content": "<p>The following was reported by <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"529807\">@Frédéric Tran Minh</span>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tauto</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--error: don't know how to synthesize placeholder</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">context:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">α : Type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">inst✝ : Inhabited α</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">fact1 : 0 = 0 ∨ ∀ (x : α), True</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">⊢ ∃ x, True</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: don't know how to synthesize placeholder</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">context:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">α : Type</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">inst✝ : Inhabited α</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">fact1 : 0 = 0 ∨ ∀ (x : α), True</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">⊢ True-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">tauto</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Here there is both a horrible <code>tauto</code> bug and horrible error reporting from Lean.</p>",
        "id": 607593297,
        "sender_full_name": "Patrick Massot",
        "timestamp": 1782906888
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Maybe I should clarify that commenting out the <code>tauto</code> restores sanity here, and the crazy things with the above code is error reporting all over the place (including on the first <code>have</code>).</p>",
        "id": 607598574,
        "sender_full_name": "Patrick Massot",
        "timestamp": 1782908447
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>is <code>tauto</code> supposed to work on all the goals at once?</p>",
        "id": 607613136,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1782912237
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110031\">@Patrick Massot</span> .  <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"816344\">@Aaron Liu</span> , I suppose tauto is only supposed to care about the current goal of type<code>True</code> but anyway replacing  <code>tauto</code> with   <code>(focus tauto) ; all_goals admit</code>   seems to result in the same behavior, with surprisingly no left goal to feed the  <code>admit</code>. Also we can still minimize <code>fact1</code> to <code>have fact1:  True ∨ True := Or.inl trivial</code> (bug still appears) but with <code>have fact1:  True := trivial</code> the bug disappears.</p>",
        "id": 607634129,
        "sender_full_name": "Frédéric Tran Minh",
        "timestamp": 1782917472
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The weird thing is that the implementation <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/a98f92c4fcb4fd3d59ebedb7d1efb9b5bb7a2695/Mathlib/Tactic/Tauto.lean#L205\">starts with a <code>focus</code></a> but indeed it still affects several goals.</p>",
        "id": 608008693,
        "sender_full_name": "Patrick Massot",
        "timestamp": 1783065546
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It’s probably defeated by <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/a98f92c4fcb4fd3d59ebedb7d1efb9b5bb7a2695/Mathlib/Tactic/Tauto.lean#L179\">this line</a>.</p>",
        "id": 608009040,
        "sender_full_name": "Patrick Massot",
        "timestamp": 1783065625
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>minimized to avoid mathlib:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MVarId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MetaM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MVarId</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">g1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g2</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getGoals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">focus</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">g1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">withContext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"before: {← getExprMVarAssignment? g2} : {← g2.getType}\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">subgoals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"after: {← getExprMVarAssignment? g2} : {← g2.getType}\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">replaceMainGoal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">subgoals</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">run_tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">runTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkIdent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fact1</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">default</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">run_tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">runTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rcases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkIdent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fact1</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">default</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">run_tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">runTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkIdent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fact1</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"o\">)))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">default</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">run_tac</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getFVarFromUserName</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`fact1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fvarId!</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·.</span><span class=\"n\">mvarId</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">default</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The problem seems to be that the <code>MVarId.cases</code> tactic (which the frontend tactics <code>cases</code>, <code>rcases</code> and <code>induction</code> do not use) reverts <code>fact1</code> inside the side goal <code>⊢ α</code> even though it is not a goal but only mentioned indirectly in the main goal</p>",
        "id": 608056700,
        "sender_full_name": "Mario Carneiro",
        "timestamp": 1783081444
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Should <code>induction</code> be cleared of suspicion? However the following fails: </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Inhabited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Or</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact2</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">focus</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 608063332,
        "sender_full_name": "Frédéric Tran Minh",
        "timestamp": 1783083526
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The problem technically lives in <code>apply</code> here: <code>apply</code> creates natural metavariables which are not really suited as tactic metavariables. Natural metavariables are fragile and meant to be assigned by definitional equality, not by tactics. One thing that can happen to them is that if you <code>mkLambdaFVars</code> on a natural metavariable, it will assign that metavariable to an application of a reverted metavariable (see <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Abstracting.20over.20a.20metavariable.20without.20assigning.20it/near/607612156\">#general &gt; Abstracting over a metavariable without assigning it @ 💬</a> for a more detailed explanation on <em>why</em>). My guess is that someone <code>mkLambdaFVars</code> or similar on the metavariable for the second goal, causing it to get assigned.<br>\nNow, why not just; <em>not</em> use natural metavariables for <code>apply</code>? Well that'd be nice but the fact that the metavariables generated by <code>apply</code> are assignable by defeq is also a feature that some proofs rely on. So we end up in a tricky spot: we want them to be assignable by defeq but we <em>still</em> want the to be tactic metavariables. I'm not sure how this conflict can be solved (maybe a new metavariable kind???).</p>",
        "id": 608073659,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1783086565
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>More progress: it's caused by <code>revert</code></p>",
        "id": 608075793,
        "sender_full_name": "Mario Carneiro",
        "timestamp": 1783087240
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>an illustrative example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- goals ?w: ⊢ α, ?h: ⊢ p ?w</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">revert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- goal is now ⊢ ∀ (fact1 : True), p (?m.14 fact1), ?w is gone</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- ?m.14 goal lost</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 608079305,
        "sender_full_name": "Mario Carneiro",
        "timestamp": 1783088304
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh I was a bit confused on how the <code>?h</code> goal got a reference to the <code>?w</code> goal but turns out that <code>pp.instantiateMVars</code> can't be trusted.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instantiateMVars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- doesn't help</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Exists</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- shows ?h ⊢ True but really is ?h ⊢ ?p ?w</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">revert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fact1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 608140333,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1783120503
    }
